    "body": "`mempool_reorg.py` is a bit confusing:\n\n* There is a `trigger_reorg` helper, but it is not used consistently.\n* It tests tx trickle delay on node1, but the global args have immediate tx relay configured for node0.\n* Using two nodes is not needed, in light of Python helpers to create forks and P2P connections.\n\nSo fix all issues by using a single node and the Python helpers.",
